xt"}],"title":"initializeSwiftModule(_:_:_:initHook:deInitHook:minimumInitializationLevel:)","symbolKind":"func","roleHeading":"Function","externalID":"s:10SwiftGodot010initializeA6Module___8initHook06deInitF026minimumInitializationLevelys13OpaquePointerV_A2GyAA11GDExtensionC0jK0OcyAKcAKtF"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"initializeSwiftModule","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"godotGetProcAddrPtr","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"OpaquePointer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s13OpaquePointerV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"libraryPtr","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"OpaquePointer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s13OpaquePointerV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"extensionPtr","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s13OpaquePointerV","text":"OpaquePointer","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"initHook"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"@escaping"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10SwiftGodot11GDExtensionC","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GDExtension","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/GDExtension"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/GDExtension\/InitializationLevel","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10SwiftGodot11GDExtensionC19InitializationLevelO","text":"InitializationLevel"},{"text":") -> (), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deInitHook","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/GDExtension","text":"GDExtension","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10SwiftGodot11GDExtensionC"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10SwiftGodot11GDExtensionC19InitializationLevelO","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/GDExtension\/InitializationLevel","text":"InitializationLevel"},{"text":") -> (), ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"minimumInitializationLevel"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/GDExtension","preciseIdentifier":"s:10SwiftGodot11GDExtensionC","text":"GDExtension"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"InitializationLevel","preciseIdentifier":"s:10SwiftGodot11GDExtensionC19InitializationLevelO","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/GDExtension\/InitializationLevel","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = .scene)","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this function from your declared Swift entry point passing the three"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pointers that you receive from Godot and passing a method that will"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"be invoked during the various stages of the initialization."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This routine takes OpaquePointers to help you simplify the declaration of"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"your Swift entry point, which can look like this:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["@cdecl(\"swift_entry_point\")","public func swift_entry_point (i: OpaquePointer?, l: OpaquePointer?, e: OpaquePointer?) -> UInt8 {","    guard let iface, let lib, let ext else {","        return 0","    }","    initializeSwiftModule (iface, lib, ext, initHook: myInit, deInitHook: myDeinit)","    return 1","}","","func myInit (level: GDExtension.InitializationLevel) {","   if level == .scene {","      registerType (MySpinningCube.self)","   }","}","","func myDeInit (level: GDExtension.InitializationLevel) {","    if level == .scene {","        print (\"Deinitialized\")","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"godotGetProcAddrPtr: the first parameter you got on your entry point, it points to the API in Godot to request pointers to the engine functions."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"libraryPtr: the second parameter you entry point gets, it is of type GDExtensionClassLibraryPtr"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"extensionPtr: the third parameter you get, it is of type GDExtensionInitialization and it is filled with our callbacks","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"initHook: this method is invoked repeatedly during the various stages of the extension","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initialization","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"deInitHook: this method is invoked repeatedly when various stages of the extension are wrapped up"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"minimumInitializationLevel: How early does this extension need to be activated? The default “scene” level should be sufficient for most cases,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"but if your Extension is only an Editor tool you could set this higher to .tool. If you need to extend base functionality set .core or .server."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/initializeswiftmodule(_:_:_:inithook:deinithook:minimuminitializationlevel:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot/GDExtension/InitializationLevel":{"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/GDExtension\/InitializationLevel","title":"GDExtension.InitializationLevel","url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/gdextension\/initializationlevel","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"InitializationLevel","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"InitializationLevel","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot","url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot","title":"SwiftGodot","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Framework to write Godot Game Extensions using the Swift Programming Language.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot/GDExtension":{"title":"GDExtension","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A native library for GDExtension.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/GDExtension","url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/gdextension","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GDExtension"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GDExtension","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot/initializeSwiftModule(_:_:_:initHook:deInitHook:minimumInitializationLevel:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"For use in extensions created for a Godot project"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/initializeswiftmodule(_:_:_:inithook:deinithook:minimuminitializationlevel:)","kind":"symbol","title":"initializeSwiftModule(_:_:_:initHook:deInitHook:minimumInitializationLevel:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGod